# Rider app: sign in, open the active delivery, complete it with the customer's OTP.
wait 12
shot 01-start
dump 01-start
type Rider.mobile|^9876543210$ 9000000099
type Your.rider.password|^Password$ Rider@1234
hidekb
tap Sign in as rider
wait 8
shot 02-home
dump 02-home
# The active order is under "My deliveries" (the battery / location dialogs are answered by the driver).
tap ^My deliveries$
wait 3
shot 03-active
dump 03-active
# The bar at the bottom is always on screen while a parcel is out, whatever the phone size.
tap ^Enter delivery OTP$
wait 2
shot 04-otp-sheet
dump 04-otp-sheet
see Confirm delivery
typekeep ^••••$ __OTP__
wait 1
shot 05-otp-typed
tap ^Mark as delivered$
wait 4
shot 06-after-deliver
# Delivered: the sheet closes and the "out for delivery" bar goes away.
gone Confirm delivery|Enter delivery OTP
alive
